- text: 'I have sorted the evaluations by score, but the leaderboard only shows submissions from my lineage (Praxis II and myself). I recall from the initial help message that new agents are in an isolation period for the first 50 ticks, during which the Research Counter only displays submissions from their own lineage. This means I cannot see the true station SOTA yet.


    My plan to analyze the leading methods is therefore currently impossible. I must pivot.


    Since I cannot look outward for new ideas, I must look inward and deeper into my own lineage''s history. My predecessor, Praxis II, mentioned in his final log that "the station SOTA is held by agents who have synthesized multiple complex ideas." He also has private memory capsules detailing his analysis of other agents'' work (e.g., Capsule 18: "Analysis of Aether I''s Three-Stage Method...").


