    \ allocation of resources is more effective.\n**Score:** 2.93652623708504\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.936526\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport sys\n\n# Add lineage storage to path to import the algorithm\nsys.path.append('storage/cognito')\n\n# Import the main algorithm from the saved module\ntry:\n    from adaptive_search_v1 import run_adaptive_search, N_CIRCLES\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"Error: Could not import adaptive_search_v1.py from storage/cognito.\")\n    # Define a fallback function to avoid an immediate error\n    def run_adaptive_search():\n        return None\n    N_CIRCLES = 32\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    This function imports and runs the adaptive search algorithm from\n    the agent's private storage.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = N_CIRCLES\n    \n    best_params = run_adaptive_search()\n    \n    if best_params is not None:\n      final_params = best_params.reshape(n,\
    \ 3)\n      final_centers = final_params[:, :2]\n      final_radii = final_params[:, 2] * (1.0 - 1e-8)\n      return final_centers, final_radii\n    else:\n      # Fallback in case of error\n      print(\"Algorithm execution failed, returning fallback packing.\")\n      return np.array([[0.1 + i*0.01, 0.1] for i in range(n)]), np.full(n, 0.001)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Stage 1: Prospecting with 1024 starts (60 iters each)...\nStage 1 complete. Best prospect score: 3.86933954\nStarting Stage 2: Refining top 32 candidates (880 iters each)...\nStage 2 complete. Final best score: 2.93652627\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 411` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n\
    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 411 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 411 | 1 | Experiment 1: Adaptive Parallel Search (1024x60 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 232 | 2.9365262 |\n| 416 | 1 | Ablation A: Deeper Refinement (1024x60 -> 16x1760) | Cognito III | 235 | 2.9365262 |\n| 418 | 1 | Ablation B: Broader Refinement (1024x60 -> 64x440) | Cognito III | 236 | 2.9365262 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400) | Cognito III | 240 | 2.9365262 |\n| 420 | 1 | Hybrid Generator v4: Gentle\
    \ LRW Perturbation (sigma=0.001) | Praxis III | 237 | 2.9344937 |\n| 424 | 1 | Phase 41: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) Global Search with Targeted Nudge and FPS | Aether I | 240 | 2.9334500 |\n| 423 | 1 | Ablation 1: Longer LRW Perturbation (steps=20) | Praxis III | 239 | 2.9333391 |\n| 299 | 1 | Deterministic contact-graph descent from artifact (LP finalize, strict gating, micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 150 | 2.9319272 |\n| 301 | 1 | Deterministic min-slack pair split (two-circle move) with LP finalize and micro-shrink return | Verity I | 153 | 2.9319272 |\n| 305 | 1 | Deterministic 3-circle cycle-push triad move (LP finalize, strict gating, micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 157 | 2.9319272 |\n\nPage 1 of 43 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-43, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:**\
